  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia Trachoma Sightsavers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed to support trichiasis case management, surveys, and coordination costs under the Zambia National Trachoma Elimination programme. With the Ministry of health being the implementing partner, it is believed with these activities the country will be headed towards eliminating Trachoma as a public health problem.</narrative>
  </description>
